以下是我找到的十篇论文：

1. "Routing protocols for B2B e-commerce logistics in cyber-physical internet(CPI)" - 作者：X Qu, M Li, Z Ouyang, C Ng, GQ Huang - 发表于Computers & Industrial Engineering, 2024
该论文探讨了B2B电子商务物流中的路由协议，集成了CPI网络中的物流概念。

2. "Establishing carbon footprints for modular integrated construction logistics using cyber-physical internet routers" - 作者：C Ng, M Li, RY Zhong, X Qu, GQ Huang - 发表于Transportation Research Part D, 2024
该论文应用CPI路由器建立模块化集成建筑物流的碳足迹框架。

3. "Cyber-Physical Internet(CPI)-enabled logistics infrastructure integration framework in the greater bay area" - 作者：H Wu, L Huang, M Li, GQ Huang - 发表于Advanced Engineering Informatics, 2024
该论文提出了大湾区基于CPI的物流基础设施整合框架。

4. "Limited data-driven router bandwidth configuration for cyber physical internet" - 作者：Y You, M Li - 发表于Expert Systems with Applications, 2025
该论文研究CPI路由器的带宽配置，从新视角探索物流领域。

5. "Cyber-physical internet shipment execution protocols for aviation maintenance, repair and overhaul intralogistics" - 作者：Q Chen, Z Zhao, Z Ouyang, Y Wang, Z Yuan - 发表于Computers & Industrial Engineering, 2025
该论文探讨航空维护、修理和大修内部物流的CPI装运执行协议。

6. "Cyber-physical Internet Driven Delivery for Small-Batch Production" - 作者：X Qu, S Zhao, GQ Huang, M Li - 发表于2024 IEEE 20th
该论文研究CPI驱动的小批量生产配送，提出了动态路由算法。

7. "Operations with physical internet" - 作者：S Pan, E Ballot, GQ Huang - 发表于Reference Module in Social Sciences, 2025
该论文讨论物流协同竞争、CPI和物流即服务等概念，包括货运路由协议。

8. "Cyber-physical internet based intelligent operation platform for off-site construction supply chain management" - 作者：L Yin, T Li, G Li, S Besklubova, RY Zhong - 发表于Enterprise Information Systems, 2024
该论文提出基于CPI的三层智能运营平台，用于场外建筑供应链管理和运输路线规划。

