llBooksConferencesCoursesJournals & MagazinesStandardsAuthorsCitations\\n[ADVANCED SEARCH ](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/search/advanced)\\n[Journals & Magazines](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/browse/periodicals/title/) >[IEEE Access](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/RecentIssue.jsp?punumber=6287639) >[Volume: 6](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/tocresult.jsp?isnumber=8274985&punumber=6287639)[](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/Xplorehelp/ieee-xplore-training/working-with-documents#interactive-html)\\n# Smart Logistics Path for Cyber-Physical Systems With Internet of Things\\nPublisher: IEEE\\nCite This\\n[PDF](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=8531718)\\n[Ning Zhang](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/author/37086546886)[](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3066-3422)\\n[All Authors](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\nView Document \\n48\\nCites in\\nPapers\\n3086\\nFull\\nText Views\\nOpen Access\\nComment(s)\\n  * [](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * [](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * [](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * [Alerts](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n# Alerts\\n[ Manage Content Alerts ](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/alerts/citation)\\n[ Add to Citation Alerts ](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n\\n\\n[Abstract](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718)\\n## Document Sections\\n  * [I.Introduction](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * [II.Related Work](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * [III.CPS Theory and Application Status](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * [IV.Design of Smart Logistics Path Decision System for CPS](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * [V.Application of Intelligent Algorithm in Intelligent Logistics Path Decision](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n\\nShow Full Outline\\n[Authors](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718/authors)\\n[Figures](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718/figures)\\n[References](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718/references)\\n[Citations](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718/citations)\\n[Keywords](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718/keywords)\\n[Metrics](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718/metrics)\\n[More Like This](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8531718/similar)\\n  * [ Download PDF ](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=8531718)\\n  * [ Download References ](javascript:void\\\\(\\\\))\\n  * Request Permissions \\n  * Save to \\n  * Alerts \\n\\n\\n![This paper proposes a path decision method based on intelligent algorithm, with the Internet of Things technology and cloud platform data storage technology introduced into the interconnection design and data processing of the equipment layer.](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/ielx7/6287639/8274985/8531718/graphical_abstract/access-gagraphic-2879966.jpg)\\nThis paper proposes a path decision method based on intelligent algorithm, with the Internet of Things technology and cloud platform data storage technology introduced in...Show More\\n##  Abstract:\\nLogistics system is developing in the direction of intelligence. The realization of smart logistics is inseparable from the coordination of logistics operation systems an...Show More\\n[Topic: Collaboration for Internet of Things](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/topics.jsp?isnumber=8274985&punumber=6287639&refinements=SpecialSection:Collaboration for Internet of Things)\\n##  Metadata \\n##  Abstract:\\nLogistics system is developing in the direction of intelligence. The realization of smart logistics is inseparable from the coordination of logistics operation systems and information systems. CyberPhysical Systems (CPS) are a new intelligent complex system that integrates deep computing, control, and communication technologies, one of its main application areas is the logistics and transportation industry. Nowadays, logistics industry is developing rapidly. Based on the existing logistics system and combining the characteristics of CPS, this paper proposes a path decision method based on intelligent algorithm. Based on the CPS logistics path decision model, the Internet of Things technology and cloud platform data storage technology are introduced into the interconnection design and data processing of the equipment layer. The application effects of ant colony algorithm, simulated annealing algorithm, and genetic algorithm in logistics path optimization are analyzed in detail. By comparing the shortest transport distance and convergence speed under the three algorithm decisions, it is concluded that the ant colony algorithm has the best path optimization effect in solving the logistics path decision.\\n[Topic: Collaboration for Internet of Things](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/topics.jsp?isnumber=8274985&punumber=6287639&refinements=SpecialSection:Collaboration for Internet of Things)\\n![This paper proposes a path decision method based on intelligent algorithm, with the Internet of Things technology and cloud platform data storage technology introduced into the interconnection design and data processing of the equipment layer.](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/ielx7/6287639/8274985/8531718/graphical_abstract/access-gagraphic-2879966.jpg)\\nThis paper proposes a path decision method based on intelligent algorithm, with the Internet of Things technology and cloud platform data storage technology introduced in...Show More\\n**Published in:**[IEEE Access](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/RecentIssue.jsp?punumber=6287639) ( Volume: 6) \\n**Page(s):** 70808 - 70819\\n**Date of Publication:** 11 November 2018 [](http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/Xplorehelp/Help_Pubdates.html)\\n**Electronic ISSN:** 2169-3536 \\n**DOI:**[10.1109/ACCESS.2018.2879966](https://doi.org/10.1109/ACCESS.2018.2879966)\\nPublisher: IEEE\\n## Funding Agency: \\n![](images/toc-icon.png) Contents \\n## \\nAuthors\\n## \\nFigures\\n## \\nReferences\\n## \\nCitations\\n## \\nKeywords\\n## \\nMetrics\\n[](https://disqus.com)\\nMore Like This \\n[Safety and Security in Cyber-Phy