ng+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024)\\n  * [按日期排序](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&scisbd=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限語言](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=&q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [搜尋所有中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-CN|lang_zh-TW&q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [搜尋繁體中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-TW&q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限類型](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [評論性文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_rr=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [包含專利](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_sdt=2007&q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW)\\n  * [只包含書目/引用資料](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_vis=1&q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n### [Establishing carbon footprints for modular integrated construction logistics using cyber-physical internet routers](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1361920924002165)\\nC Ng, [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [RY Zhong](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=KfDl2DIAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [X Qu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OFfv_0IAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra) - Transportation Research Part D …, 2024 - Elsevier\\nC Ng, [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [RY Zhong](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=KfDl2DIAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [X Qu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OFfv_0IAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nTransportation Research Part D: Transport and Environment, 2024•Elsevier\\nModular integrated construction (MiC) logistics is controversial regarding carbon emissions due to the increased weight of shipped modules. Logistics companies prefer efficiency-oriented and profit-oriented demand, which leads to limited carbon reduction. Relying on road transport intensifies these challenges, highlighting the need for improved strategies to mitigate environmental impacts. This study proposes adopting the concept of the cyber-physical internet (CPI) to digitalize carbon footprints in MiC logistics. A CPI carbon footprint …\\nAbstract\\nModular integrated construction (MiC) logistics is controversial regarding carbon emissions due to the increased weight of shipped modules. Logistics companies prefer efficiency-oriented and profit-oriented demand, which leads to limited carbon reduction. Relying on road transport intensifies these challenges, highlighting the need for improved strategies to mitigate environmental impacts. This study proposes adopting the concept of the cyber-physical internet (CPI) to digitalize carbon footprints in MiC logistics. A CPI carbon footprint framework is established by routers in MiC logistics. The unique characteristics of MiC and real-world instances are integrated into the proposed routing protocol. A routing algorithm for carbon emissions is improved by considering heavy trucks’ speed and loading capacities. Simulation studies are conducted using real-world data and databases to investigate the impacts of loading capacity and average speed on carbon footprints. This study contributes to the theoretical understanding and offers practical guidelines for effectively reducing carbon emissions in MiC logistics.\\nElsevier\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [被引用 6 次](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=6797346103843651821&as_sdt=2005&sciodt=0,5&hl=zh-TW) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:7YD8fkQGVV4J:scholar.google.com/&scioq=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5) [全部共 4 個版本](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cluster=6797346103843651821&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示更多服務\\\") [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示較少服務\\\")\\n顯示最佳搜尋結果。 [查看所有結果](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lookup=0&q=%22Establishing+carbon+footprints+for+modular+integrated+construction+logistics+using+cyber-physical+internet+routers%22+C+Ng+M+Li+RY+Zhong+X+Qu+GQ+Huang+Transportation+Research+Part+D+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n[隱私權](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/privacy/)[服務條款](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/terms/)[說明](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[關於學術搜尋](https://scholar.google.com/intl/zh-TW/scholar/about.html)[Google 搜尋說明](https://support.google.com/websearch?p=scholar_dsa&hl=zh-TW)\\n\",\n  \"total_lines\": 85,\n  \"line_range\": \"1-85\",\n  \"file_path\": \"upload/scholar_results/Establishing_carbon_footprints_for_modular_integrated_construction_logistics_using_cyber_physical_internet_routers_C_Ng_M_Li_RY_Zhong_X_Qu_GQ_Huang_Transportation_Research_Part_D_2024.md\",\n  \"container_path\": \"/workspace/tasks/agent_test/upload/scholar_results/Establishing_carbon_footprints_for_modular_integrated_construction_logistics_using_cyber_physical_internet_routers_C_Ng_M_Li_RY_Zhong_X_Qu_GQ_Huang_Transportation_Research_Part_D_2024.md\"\n}",
