holar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-TW&q=%22CYBER-PHYSICAL+LOGISTICS+SYSTEM-BASED+VEHICLE+ROUTING+OPTIMIZATION%22+M+Lai+H+Yang+S+Yang+J+Zhao+Journal+of+Industrial+%26+Management+Optimization+2014&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限類型](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22CYBER-PHYSICAL+LOGISTICS+SYSTEM-BASED+VEHICLE+ROUTING+OPTIMIZATION%22+M+Lai+H+Yang+S+Yang+J+Zhao+Journal+of+Industrial+%26+Management+Optimization+2014&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [評論性文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22CYBER-PHYSICAL+LOGISTICS+SYSTEM-BASED+VEHICLE+ROUTING+OPTIMIZATION%22+M+Lai+H+Yang+S+Yang+J+Zhao+Journal+of+Industrial+%26+Management+Optimization+2014&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_rr=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [包含專利](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_sdt=2007&q=%22CYBER-PHYSICAL+LOGISTICS+SYSTEM-BASED+VEHICLE+ROUTING+OPTIMIZATION%22+M+Lai+H+Yang+S+Yang+J+Zhao+Journal+of+Industrial+%26+Management+Optimization+2014&hl=zh-TW)\\n  * [只包含書目/引用資料](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_vis=1&q=%22CYBER-PHYSICAL+LOGISTICS+SYSTEM-BASED+VEHICLE+ROUTING+OPTIMIZATION%22+M+Lai+H+Yang+S+Yang+J+Zhao+Journal+of+Industrial+%26+Management+Optimization+2014&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n### [CYBER-PHYSICAL LOGISTICS SYSTEM-BASED VEHICLE ROUTING OPTIMIZATION.](https://search.ebscohost.com/login.aspx?direct=true&profile=ehost&scope=site&authtype=crawler&jrnl=15475816&AN=92878154&h=UT6%2B9iM7JnbkmVzb%2BVfKsz6iD9GxPA8Ewt%2FHxsHU1e0YQrTB02YOpbxcAlJT1nj62lhMRsDLDAPNQH%2Bn8JhkJw%3D%3D&crl=c)\\nM Lai, H Yang, S Yang, [J Zhao](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=M2oDRWEAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)… - Journal of Industrial & …, 2014 - search.ebscohost.com\\nM Lai, H Yang, S Yang, [J Zhao](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=M2oDRWEAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [Y Xu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=ZAhePQ4AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nJournal of Industrial & Management Optimization, 2014•search.ebscohost.com\\nVehicle routing problem is a classic combinational optimization problem, which has been attracting research attentions in logistics and optimization area. Conventional static vehicle routing problem assumes the logistics information is accurate and timely, and does not take into account the uncertainties, which is therefore inadequate during practical applications. In this paper, a vehicle initial routing optimization model considering uncertainties is proposed, the vehicle capacity, customer time-window, and the maximum travelling distance as well as …\\nAbstract\\nVehicle routing problem is a classic combinational optimization problem, which has been attracting research attentions in logistics and optimization area. Conventional static vehicle routing problem assumes the logistics information is accurate and timely, and does not take into account the uncertainties, which is therefore inadequate during practical applications. In this paper, a vehicle initial routing optimization model considering uncertainties is proposed, the vehicle capacity, customer time-window, and the maximum travelling distance as well as the road capacity are considered. In the cyberphysical logistics system background, a routing adjustment model is proposed to minimize the total distribution cost considering the road congestion, and the static and dynamic models are proposed for trafic information transmission network to quantitatively analyse the impact of the trafic information transmission delay on the vehicle routing optimization. The learnable genetic algorithm is adopted to solve the initial routing optimization model and the routing adjustment model. The simulation results have verified its effectiveness.\\nsearch.ebscohost.com\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [被引用 34 次](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=15964531335813412945&as_sdt=2005&sciodt=0,5&hl=zh-TW) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:UTjAjKpojd0J:scholar.google.com/&scioq=%22CYBER-PHYSICAL+LOGISTICS+SYSTEM-BASED+VEHICLE+ROUTI