y+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024)\\n  * [按日期排序](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&scisbd=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限語言](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [搜尋所有中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-CN|lang_zh-TW&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [搜尋繁體中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-TW&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限類型](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [評論性文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_rr=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [包含專利](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_sdt=2007&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW)\\n  * [只包含書目/引用資料](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_vis=1&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n### [Cyber-Physical Internet (CPI)-enabled logistics infrastructure integration framework in the greater bay area](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S147403462400199X)\\n[H Wu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=4lowawoAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), L Huang, [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra) - Advanced Engineering Informatics, 2024 - Elsevier\\n[H Wu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=4lowawoAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), L Huang, [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nAdvanced Engineering Informatics, 2024•Elsevier\\nThe emerging digital economy has facilitated the digital transformation of the logistics industry toward a standard and collaborative state. The logistics infrastructure has accordingly attracted much attention as the basis for supporting digital economy implementation. Moreover, the initiatives of regional collaborative development, such as in the Greater Bay Area (GBA) of China, have accelerated the integration of logistics infrastructure and operation-level collaboration. Fortunately, the Cyber-Physical Internet …\\nAbstract\\nThe emerging digital economy has facilitated the digital transformation of the logistics industry toward a standard and collaborative state. The logistics infrastructure has accordingly attracted much attention as the basis for supporting digital economy implementation. Moreover, the initiatives of regional collaborative development, such as in the Greater Bay Area (GBA) of China, have accelerated the integration of logistics infrastructure and operation-level collaboration. Fortunately, the Cyber-Physical Internet (CPI) has created new opportunities for promoting infrastructure integration through the cyber, physical and internet dimensions. However, regional infrastructure integration in the GBA faces various challenges associated with CPI network operations. Thus, a bottom-up approach is proposed to facilitate logistics infrastructure integration in the CPI environment based on the conceptual fusion of computer networks. Considering the fundamental difference in network fusion and operation mechanisms between CPI and computer networks, a CPI-LI2 (logistics infrastructure integration) framework is designed as an integrated solution. Finally, a simulation study is conducted using real-life medical logistics data from the GBA to verify the effectiveness of the CPI-LI2 framework. Experiments show that the framework is well adapted to large-scale logistics networks with dynamically changing links.\\nElsevier\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [被引用 11 次](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=1579773190946367748&as_sdt=2005&sciodt=0,5&hl=zh-TW) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:BCkL4Fh77BUJ:scholar.google.com/&scioq=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5) [全部共 4 個版本](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cluster=1579773190946367748&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示更多服務\\\") [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示較少服務\\\")\\n顯示最佳搜尋結果。 [查看所有結果](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lookup=0&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)-enabled+logistics+infrastructure+integration+framework+in+the+greater+bay+area%22+H+Wu+L+Huang+M+Li+GQ+Huang+Advanced+Engineering+Informatics+2024&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n[隱私權](ht