由决策。\n   - \"Out-of-Order Architecture for Real-Time Data-Driven Resilient Planning and Scheduling of Cyber-Physical Manufacturing Systems\" (Li等, 2025)\n     - 这篇论文提出了一种乱序架构，用于基于实时数据的网络物理制造系统的弹性规划和调度。", "error_information": ""}}]}
